# 📐 DAX Measures

The project uses DAX measures to calculate important business KPIs.

Examples include:

### Total Quantity Sold

```DAX
Total Quantity Sold =
SUM(Sales[Quantity])
```

### Total Sales

```DAX
Total Sales =
SUM(Sales[Sales])
```

### Average Selling Price

```DAX
Average Selling Price =
AVERAGE(Sales[Sales])
```

### Total Transactions

```DAX
Total Transactions =
COUNTROWS(Sales)
```

### Unique Items Sold

```DAX
Unique Items Sold =
DISTINCTCOUNT(Sales[ProductID])
```

> Update the table/column names if your final Power BI model uses different names.

